{%- comment -%}
  QA preview for the individual-order page — /search?view=order-preview

  The real page (templates/customers/order.liquid) needs a logged-in customer who owns an
  order, so its layout cannot be opened locally. This renders the SAME section with mock
  values, so what you check here is the real markup and CSS, not a copy that can drift.

  The section decides which data to use from the global `template`, which carries this
  file's suffix. An alternate SEARCH template is used because /search always resolves,
  while a page template would need a matching page resource in the admin.

  Internal QA only — do not link from storefront nav.
{%- endcomment -%}
